                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you enjoy a visual novel with some sauciness, as I do, the LoveKami series may very well be for you! \n\nEasy to score 100% Steam achievements, too. \n\nIn this episode, you manage performing goddesses. \nIn the setting, manufactured pop idols are all goddesses who need the applause of fans to survive. \nIt's a little dark when you think about it. \n\nThere's a nice mix of personalities, along the classic lines of a trio. \n\nThere's an old friend of your family, who's an established performer in a famous group already, but is seeking to branch out; she's mellow and surprisingly innocent. \nThere's an up-and-coming young pop star you meet on the street while she's effectively doing high-end busking; she's ambitious and likeable, my personal favorite. \nThere's a provocative young goddess, who works at a trashy restaurant; she's kind of an underdog, down on her luck, and very easy to root for.",
